                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h2>In a rather remote but quite special and scenically spectacular location</h2>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<p>We invite you to share with us the delights of self catering accommodation on the North Nottinghamshire &amp; South Yorkshire border, in the very heart of the Idle River Valley near to the village of Mattersey.</p> <p>In an area rich with Outdoor Activities that will be fun for all the family.</p> <p><strong>All cottages have the following facilities;-</strong><br> Electric cooker &amp; hotplates, Dishwasher, Microwave, Fridge with icebox or Freezer, Smart Television, DVD Player, Patio Furniture Shared BBQ, Gas Central Heating. Laundry room with washing machines and drier, ironing facility, Childrens play area Large carpark, with some covered spaces.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
