                  "html": "<h3> Swallow - Sleeps 5</h3> <p>A spacious 2 bedroomed cottage offers open plan kitchen dining living area with large glass windows giving a bright and airy feel. A huge master bedroom with ensuite corner bath and shower and twin room with ensuite shower.</p>",
