                  },
                  "html": "<h3> Cuckoo - Sleeps 4</h3> <p>Accessed up stairs this single level cottage offers open plan living with high beamed ceilings and great views across the farm. Both the master and twin are spacious rooms with ensuite bath and showers.</p>",
