              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "html": "<h4>Blaco Hill Farm Cottages are situated on a working farm just outside Mattersey, on the Nottinghamshire and South Yorkshire border.</h4> <p>On the farm itself are three lakes, which have a wide variety of bird life both native and visiting species.</p> <p>Adjacent to the farm is the Nottinghamshire Wildlife Trusts Idle Valley nature reserve, which is a site of Special Scientific Interest and has a diverse variety of bird &amp; wildlife.</p> <p>In an area rich with Outdoor Activities that will be fun for all the family. And if the weather is not so good we have a Games Room equipped with a full size snooker table, table tennis and a large comfortable seating area. Please feel free to look around our site.</p> <p>We do hope you find Blaco Hill a relaxing, care-free environment and hopefully we will have the pleasure of your company in the near future.</p> <p>We are here for you – to help you plan, organize, and fulfill your dreams of a relaxing, self catering holiday away from all the stresses of everyday life, here in Mattersey.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": "1_2",
              "modules": [
